{"unit_id":"sxwer001__dsh-collab-dev#feature-1","repo":"sxwer001/dsh-collab-dev","commit":"294a992965a2dc213baece810bc7073462aead45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-collab-dev** 的功能「计划校验」：主智能体保存计划时检查任务类型、负责人、依赖图、阶段完整性和独立审查；循环、缺失依赖、并行写入范围冲突或缺少集成验收会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plan.js:43-141"]}
{"unit_id":"sxwer001__dsh-collab-dev#feature-2","repo":"sxwer001/dsh-collab-dev","commit":"294a992965a2dc213baece810bc7073462aead45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-collab-dev** 的功能「并行协作启动」：主智能体调用启动工具后创建待审批的 AgentTeams 团队，并逐项映射计划依赖；实现任务需声明工作区路径和验证命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:62-90","cordis.patch.yml:21-57"]}
{"unit_id":"sxwer001__dsh-collab-dev#feature-3","repo":"sxwer001/dsh-collab-dev","commit":"294a992965a2dc213baece810bc7073462aead45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-collab-dev** 的功能「协作命令入口」：用户运行 `/collab-dev <目标>` 后，主会话收到先制定架构、保存完整计划并创建团队草稿的请求；空目标或超过 4000 字符会返回用法错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:104-114"]}
{"unit_id":"sxwer001__dsh-collab-dev#feature-4","repo":"sxwer001/dsh-collab-dev","commit":"294a992965a2dc213baece810bc7073462aead45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-collab-dev** 的功能「进度与交付状态」：用户运行 `/collab-status` 或调用状态工具，可查看任务完成情况、验证和集成输出、成员进度以及交付阻塞和提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:94-102","src/index.js:116-122","src/status.js:2-39"]}
{"unit_id":"sxwer001__dsh-collab-dev#caveat-1","repo":"sxwer001/dsh-collab-dev","commit":"294a992965a2dc213baece810bc7073462aead45","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collab-dev 的团队使用共享工作区，bundle 未配置文件系统隔离；团队成员工具策略仅禁止其调用三个规划/状态工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-19","src/index.js:29"]}
